sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Ad as Administrator
    actor F as Finance desk
    participant FI as finance-service
    participant AD as admission-service

    Ad->>FI: PUT /api/fees/gst/settings (rate, GSTIN, SAC, applies from)
    FI->>FI: rate 0 to 28, GSTIN shape checked, a start date inside a closed period is refused
    FI->>FI: audit the change

    F->>FI: record a payment, or download its receipt
    FI->>AD: student's phone and state (Feign)
    FI->>FI: rate in force on the payment date (zero before the start date)
    FI->>FI: each fee head it went towards is taxed, a head marked no GST is exempt
    alt the student's state differs from the state in the GSTIN
        FI->>FI: IGST
    else same state, or unknown
        FI->>FI: CGST and SGST, half each
    end
    FI-->>F: Tax Invoice cum Fees Receipt (taxable value, taxes, place of supply, GSTIN, SAC). With no GST it says so

    F->>FI: add an expense with the GST in it
    FI->>FI: the GST is a credit against what is owed
    F->>FI: POST /api/fees/gst/payments (challan: month, amount, method, reference)
    FI->>FI: refuse a date inside a closed period

    F->>FI: GET /api/fees/gst/summary (from, to)
    FI->>FI: invoices = payments net of refunds, with their tax
    FI->>FI: month by month: tax charged - credit on expenses - paid = still payable
    FI-->>F: GST return and invoice register (both download)

    F->>FI: GET /api/fees/books (from, to)
    FI->>FI: journal worked out from plans, payments, refunds, expenses and GST payments
    FI-->>F: trial balance, profit and loss, balance sheet, each entry balanced
